        "raw": "During a game over the weekend, a conversation with Christopher and some other folks came up around the flavor text on Living Conflagration. I have a variety of Egyptian-style fonts (as a role-playing game GM, they've come in handy in the past), and I thought the font looked familiar, but I haven't made the time to translate it. \n\nSo I decided I needed to resolve that issue. :)\n\nAfter a little time comparing fonts, I determined the font was Hieroglify (or at least something close to it). It only took me \"_ _ rist _ _ er   _ _ _   _ _ _ _\" before I knew what it said, but I finished the exercise, anyway.  ;)\n\nHas anyone else worked through this?  8)\n\nRabit",
